# sync/arbor.manifest — agent wiring for forestrie/arbor: Go services on GKE.
# Apply: agentfiles sync <path-to-arbor> --manifest <this file>
# Format: see sync/README.md. A relative 'source' resolves against this file's directory.
#
# Public repos get no copies: the plugins below arrive live, in
# terminal sessions from the forestrie profile and in cloud sessions from the
# SessionStart install hook that sync writes. arbor owns its rules of the road
# (.claude/rules/rules-of-the-road-arbor.md).

source ..

marketplace forestrie-agents forestrie/forestrie-agents
plugin forestrie-core@forestrie-agents
plugin mattpocock-skills@forestrie-agents
